  "abstract": "After analyzing the new SOTA (Ariadne I, ID 92), this experiment tests the integration of one of its key concepts. A `ResidualCopyHead`, which provides a strong baseline for short-term forecasts, is added as a parallel branch to my SOTA MoE-ConvGate architecture (ID 76). The goal is to see if this hybrid approach can synergize the strengths of both models and significantly improve my best score.",
